<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ConsRutile half yr net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ConsRutile half yr net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>	    (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  8.59 vs 7.94</p>
<p>    Net profit			  4.56 vs 5.26</p>
<p>    Sales				26.43 vs 31.71</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		   nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Consolidated Rutile Ltd is 50.14 percent owned by Cudgen RZ Ltd, itself a 76.7 percent owned unit of mining house RGC Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
</text>
